{"a":[1,5],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>Bu sûrei Hûddur ve hepsi Mekiyyedir. Ancak İbni Abbastan bir rivayette «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"92\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 91.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 14.3 14.3 22.6 29.3 45.0 61.6 61.6 68.3 75.0 81.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"29.3 45.0 61.6 68.3 75.0 81.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kavli celîli istisna edilmiştir. Mukatil de: hepsi Mekkîdir, ancak «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"92\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 91.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 14.2 14.2 22.4 29.2 45.0 61.4 61.4 68.2 75.0 81.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"29.2 45.0 61.4 68.2 75.0 81.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyeti değil, bir de « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"131\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 130.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 25.6 36.0 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.7 57.7 57.7 66.0 66.0 81.7 98.3 98.3 105.0 105.0 105.0 112.6 112.6 120.7 120.7\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"25.6 81.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » İbni Selâm ve eshabı hakkında nâzil oldu « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"225\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 224.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 19.6 26.3 33.0 33.0 33.0 39.7 51.7 59.3 75.0 85.6 85.6 92.3 92.3 101.3 101.3 110.3 110.3 126.0 126.0 142.6 149.3 168.0 180.7 180.7 188.3 204.0 204.0 214.6 214.6\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\">